WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.890
Saul was a persecutor
of the first Christians,

2
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.460
and proud of it.

3
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:09.670
Then, Christians believe, he met Jesus,
and as Paul he became an apostle of the

4
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.720
faith he had attacked.

5
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:15.870
In the Bible, Moses takes off his
sandals before a burning bush,

6
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.790
afraid to look at God.

7
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.420
When someone says they
have experienced God,

8
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:22.710
should anyone else believe them?

9
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.160
In this mission, you'll
sort experiences into kinds:

10
00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:29.800
conversion, numinous, mystical and more.

11
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:33.900
Then you'll weigh up the challenges,
from hallucination to wish-fulfilment,

12
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.220
and how believers reply.

13
00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:40.520
Your mission: weigh up whether anyone
else should believe a person who says they

14
00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.030
have experienced God.
